  "author": "PAPAGEDON",
  "description": "Twenty original night-themed, dreamy, classy R&B cocktail visuals for the outdoor TRANCE event. Built as slow immersive GLSL fragments with moonlight, velvet, glass, champagne, mist, petals, and lounge constellations.",
